    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d181">

                <pb facs="0439" n="403" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v07p1/pg403"/>

                <head>181. Telegram From the Delegation at the North Atlantic Council Ministerial
                    Meeting to the Department of State<anchor n="0" xml:id="d181-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Paris</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1958-12-18T22:00:00+01:00">December 18, 1958,
                            10 p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Polto 1759. From USDel. NATO Ministerial Council, meeting in restricted session
                    afternoon December 18,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d181-f2"/> after completing action
                    on defense resolution (reported separately),<anchor n="2" xml:id="d181-f3"/>
                    turned to draft communiqué. Communiqué was agreed and text is being transmitted
                        separately.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d181-f4"/></p>
                <p>At conclusion of meeting Secretary expressed appreciation of Council to Spaak for
                    manner in which latter had guided Council’s fruitful deliberations. Secretary
                    also thanked International Staff for their <pb facs="0440" n="404"
                        xml:id="pg404"/> work. Secretary said that spirit of unity displayed by NATO
                    at this Ministerial meeting was best guarantee that peace would continue to be
                    maintained.</p>
                <p>Meeting ended at 6 p.m.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d181-f1" n="0" type="source" xml:id="d181-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 396.1–PA/12–1858. Confidential.
                    Pouched to the other NATO capitals.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d181-f2" n="1" xml:id="d181-f2-content">
                <p>The verbatim (C–VR(58)68) record of this session, dated December 18, is <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., Conference Files: Lot 64 D 560, CF 1178. No
                    summary record of this session has been found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d181-f3" n="2" xml:id="d181-f3-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d180">Document 180</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d181-f4" n="3" xml:id="d181-f4-content">
                <p>The draft communiqué has not been found. For text of the final communiqué,
                    December 18, see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin,</hi>
                    January 5, 1959, pp. 3–4.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
